3:["$","li","02",{"children":["Feature animation",". ","Lottie sequences built in Jitter to show the product's main features moving, which static UI shots could never do."]}]
4:["$","li","03",{"children":["The agent demo",". ","A preview of the personal-agent feature running live on the OpenAI API, built when ChatGPT was still basic chat and 'agents' weren't a category yet."]}]
